      "description": "This service provides the hydrologic feature data made available as part of the National Hydrologic Geospatial Fabric (NHGF). The NHGF is a geospatial dataset of connected rivers, stream, lakes, catchments, hydrologic locations, and relevant attributes to support hydrologic modeling and analysis."
